        1. Create a mysterious, prophetic subtitle (max 50 chars).
        2. Create a compelling 2-sentence 'unsealed' blurb for the description.
        Context: Trick Theology brand - decoding biblical secrets and global prophecy.`,
        config: {
          responseMimeType: "application/json",
          responseSchema: {
            type: Type.OBJECT,
            properties: {
              subtitle: { type: Type.STRING },
              blurb: { type: Type.STRING }
            },
            required: ["subtitle", "blurb"]
          }
        }
      });
      const data = JSON.parse(response.text);
      setBookForm(prev => ({ ...prev, subtitle: data.subtitle, description: data.blurb }));
